Subject: [PATCH] Disable unsupported Wi-Fi sharing before interface selection on One UI 9

The common join overrides vendor-derived sharing flags in the donor. Reset
both flags here so queries, interface selection and published Lite state agree.
Keep power-save support and all vendor capability parsing intact.

diff --git a/smali/com/samsung/android/server/wifi/ap/SemWifiApChipInfo.smali b/smali/com/samsung/android/server/wifi/ap/SemWifiApChipInfo.smali
--- a/smali/com/samsung/android/server/wifi/ap/SemWifiApChipInfo.smali
+++ b/smali/com/samsung/android/server/wifi/ap/SemWifiApChipInfo.smali
@@ -664,7 +664,9 @@
 
     :cond_3
     :goto_0
-    sput-boolean v5, Lcom/samsung/android/server/wifi/ap/SemWifiApChipInfo;->mSupportWifiSharing:Z
+    sput-boolean v4, Lcom/samsung/android/server/wifi/ap/SemWifiApChipInfo;->mSupportWifiSharing:Z
+
+    sput-boolean v4, Lcom/samsung/android/server/wifi/ap/SemWifiApChipInfo;->mSupportWifiSharingLite:Z
 
     new-instance v2, Ljava/lang/StringBuilder;
 
